{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「Lonesome rabbit」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「What’s “KAZOKU”?」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日発売日です"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも応援してくださりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めての、両A面シングルになります"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "表題曲が2曲 !"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "不思議な感じです"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どちらも素敵な楽曲。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Lonesome rabbit"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/4HfAH746QJo"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "What’s “KAZOKU”?"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/4SdeuouXcWI"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "コインランドリー"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/ae6N-FcsJmQ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob6qSIrF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobl05eYi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobX5Nakt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回もマネージャーさんカメラ。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すっごい自然な笑顔"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "穏やかな撮影現場でした~"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobNKfejR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobExleiu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "珍しい髪型にも挑戦してみました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メイクさんと話し合って決めた"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobsJ42TM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobasD7cV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「コインランドリー」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても綺麗に撮っていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "衣装が繊細で"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美しかったです"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして理子ちゃんは本当に綺麗だーー…"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美人さん"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobzZTCDE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "優月ちゃん"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回はお姉さんずに挟まれています"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんて安心。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このシングル期間とっても楽しみです~"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobDPuGIk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single もよろしくお願いいたします。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "村山美羽"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobfCYFPL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お気に入りの一枚。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂、好きだなあってなった写真"}], "source": "official"}